Package: lrcpq
Type: Package
Title: Phenome-Wide Genetic-Effect Enrichment and Correlation from GWAS Summary Statistics
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Lane", "Chen", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "lanechenhku@gmail.com"),
    person("Pak Chung", "Sham", role = "aut"))
Description: Implements the unified matrix-normal framework for phenome-wide
    genetic-effect variance (LRCQ: per-SNP enrichment w) and genetic-effect
    correlation (LRCP: SNP-pair correlation R_beta) estimated from many GWAS
    summary statistics and an LD reference. Provides a simulation engine,
    LD utilities, LD score regression for heritability, co-heritability and
    intercepts, and the four-stage LRCQ/LRCP estimators.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports: Matrix, methods, stats
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), data.table, knitr, rmarkdown
Config/testthat/edition: 3
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
